{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-61291","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-92841","text":"FleetPrompt — The Open Agent Marketplace"}]},{"id":"blk-61292","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-92842","text":"Discover, publish, and install production-ready AI agents. Built on trust scores, versioned manifests, and one-click deployment."}]},{"id":"blk-61293","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-92843","text":"Source-of-truth spec"}]},{"id":"blk-61294","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61296","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-92844","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/spec/README.md"},{"id":"spn-92845","text":" — FleetPrompt technical specification"}]}],"id":"blk-61295","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61298","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-92846","marks":["code"],"text":"prompts/BUILD.md"},{"id":"spn-92847","text":" — Implementation build prompt (9 phases)"}]}],"id":"blk-61297","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-61299","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-92848","text":"Stack"}]},{"id":"blk-61300","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Language:     Elixir 1.17+ / OTP 27\nFramework:    Phoenix 1.8 (LiveView for UI, PubSub for trust broadcasts)\nDatabase:     PostgreSQL via shared Supabase (fleet.* schema, migrations 030-039)\nSearch:       pg_trgm + ts_vector (no external search infra)\nHot Cache:    ETS (:fp_manifests, :fp_trust_scores, :fp_search_index, :fp_categories)\nBackground:   Oban (trust recompute, webhook delivery, search index refresh)\nAuth:         Supabase Auth (shared [&] ecosystem — amp.profiles, amp.workspaces)\nDeploy:       Mix release + Docker on Fly.io"},{"id":"blk-61301","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-92849","text":"Build commands"}]},{"id":"blk-61302","kind":"code","language":"bash","text":"mix deps.get\nmix compile --warnings-as-errors\nmix format --check-formatted\nmix test                          # requires running Supabase for DB tests\nmix test test/fleet_prompt/       # unit tests (no DB required for most)"},{"id":"blk-61303","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-92850","text":"Key modules"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-61305","spans":[{"id":"spn-92851","text":"Module"}]},{"id":"blk-61306","spans":[{"id":"spn-92852","text":"Purpose"}]}],"id":"blk-61304","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-61307","spans":[{"id":"spn-92853","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Registry"}]},{"id":"blk-61308","spans":[{"id":"spn-92854","text":"Agent + manifest CRUD, version immutability, status transitions"}]}],[{"id":"blk-61309","spans":[{"id":"spn-92855","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Trust.Engine"}]},{"id":"blk-61310","spans":[{"id":"spn-92856","text":"4-signal weighted trust computation (test 30%, spec 25%, usage 25%, audit 20%)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-61311","spans":[{"id":"spn-92857","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Trust.Worker"}]},{"id":"blk-61312","spans":[{"id":"spn-92858","text":"GenServer per agent — recomputes, caches in ETS, broadcasts via PubSub"}]}],[{"id":"blk-61313","spans":[{"id":"spn-92859","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Trust.Supervisor"}]},{"id":"blk-61314","spans":[{"id":"spn-92860","text":"DynamicSupervisor managing TrustWorkers"}]}],[{"id":"blk-61315","spans":[{"id":"spn-92861","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Search"}]},{"id":"blk-61316","spans":[{"id":"spn-92862","text":"pg_trgm + ts_vector full-text search with filters"}]}],[{"id":"blk-61317","spans":[{"id":"spn-92863","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Forks"}]},{"id":"blk-61318","spans":[{"id":"spn-92864","text":"Fork-and-customize with provenance tracking"}]}],[{"id":"blk-61319","spans":[{"id":"spn-92865","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.PipelineIntake"}]},{"id":"blk-61320","spans":[{"id":"spn-92866","text":"ConsolidationEvent processing from Agentelic"}]}],[{"id":"blk-61321","spans":[{"id":"spn-92867","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.InstallEngine"}]},{"id":"blk-61322","spans":[{"id":"spn-92868","text":"Install flow with permission checks"}]}],[{"id":"blk-61323","spans":[{"id":"spn-92869","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.AuditWriter"}]},{"id":"blk-61324","spans":[{"id":"spn-92870","text":"Append-only audit event recording"}]}],[{"id":"blk-61325","spans":[{"id":"spn-92871","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.WebhookDispatcher"}]},{"id":"blk-61326","spans":[{"id":"spn-92872","text":"Oban worker for async webhook delivery"}]}],[{"id":"blk-61327","spans":[{"id":"spn-92873","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Cache"}]},{"id":"blk-61328","spans":[{"id":"spn-92874","text":"ETS GenServer with 4 named tables"}]}],[{"id":"blk-61329","spans":[{"id":"spn-92875","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.MCP.Server"}]},{"id":"blk-61330","spans":[{"id":"spn-92876","text":"MCP JSON-RPC server (7 tools)"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-61331","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-92877","text":"Supabase schema"}]},{"id":"blk-61332","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-92878","text":"Tables live in "},{"id":"spn-92879","marks":["code"],"text":"fleet.*"},{"id":"spn-92880","text":" schema (migrations 030-039 in "},{"id":"spn-92881","marks":["code"],"text":"ampersand-supabase/migrations/"},{"id":"spn-92882","text":"):"}]},{"id":"blk-61333","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61335","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-92883","marks":["code"],"text":"fleet.publishers"},{"id":"spn-92884","text":" — marketplace publisher profiles"}]}],"id":"blk-61334","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61337","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-92885","marks":["code"],"text":"fleet.agents"},{"id":"spn-92886","text":" — agent listings with search_vector"}]}],"id":"blk-61336","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61339","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-92887","marks":["code"],"text":"fleet.agent_versions"},{"id":"spn-92888","text":" — semver-versioned releases with JSONB manifest"}]}],"id":"blk-61338","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-61341","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-92889","marks":["code